{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52004","headline":"独坐 · 王绩","name":"独坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"托身千载下，聊思（《韵语阳秋》作「游」）万物初。\n欲令无作有，翻觉实成虚。\n周文方定策，秦帝即焚书。\n寄语无爲者，知君悟有余。\n（按：《韵语阳秋》卷十一、《文献通考》卷二三一、《经籍考》引《周氏涉笔》收前四句，《全唐诗》卷三七收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}